          <summary class="faq-q">Wer sind die Avorix-K&ouml;che?<svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 6.75L9 11.25L13.5 6.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></summary>
